## 6.4 Loss Function

Binary Cross Entropy loss was used for binary classification.

L = -(1/N) Σ [ y log(ŷ) + (1-y) log(1-ŷ) ]

Where:

* y = true label
* ŷ = predicted probability
* N = number of samples

