# 8. Model Training

## 8.1 Experiment 1 (V1)

The first CNN architecture achieved:

* stable validation performance
* high validation accuracy
* strong recall and precision

This model was selected as the final model.

---

## 8.2 Experiment 2 (V2)

A second CNN experiment was conducted using:

* smaller image size
* stronger augmentation
* higher dropout
* simplified architecture

Although training became faster, the validation performance became less stable and overfitting still appeared after several epochs.

Therefore, Experiment 1 was selected as the final model.

